:name: Python peripheral on the BlackPill F411 model
:description: A register-level temperature sensor written in Python inside the .repl; the firmware polls it.
$elf?=$ex_out/pysensor_demo.elf

using sysbus
mach create "pysensor"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/pysensor.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
# change the temperature while it runs: sysbus WriteDoubleWord 0x40080010 3075
